{"id":"fuerza","lemma":"fuerza","pos":"noun","rank":496,"glosses":["force","strength"],"ipa":"/ˈfweɾθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fuerzas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-fuerza.wav","formAudio":{"fuerzas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-fuerzas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Fuerza la puerta.","en":"Kick the door in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442811","words":[null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"}]},{"text":"Ya no tengo fuerzas para hablar.","en":"I no longer have the energy to talk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1191440","words":[null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to talk"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"no longer"]]},{"text":"Ella le golpeó con fuerza.","en":"She hit him hard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442912","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Esto me da fuerzas para continuar.","en":"This gives me the strength to go on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788422","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to continue"}]},{"text":"Habrá que hacerlo a la fuerza.","en":"It'll have to be done forcibly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594637","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}